text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E18D {
    "Welcome to the OCEANIC MUSEUM.\pThe entrance fee is ¥50.\nWould you like to enter?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E1DE {
    "Please enjoy yourself."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E1F5 {
    "Oh? I’m sorry, but you don’t seem to\nhave enough money."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E22D {
    "Oh? You’re with that group that\nwent in earlier?\pYou’re the only one who’s late.\nYou’d better go catch up to them!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E2BB {
    "We, TEAM {AQUA}, exist for the good\nof all!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E2E3 {
    "We were told to assemble here, so\nwe did, but...\pOur BOSS, the lynchpin, isn’t here."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E338 {
    "If I ripped off the stuff here,\nwould it make me rich?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E36F {
    "What I learn here, I can put to use on\nnefarious deeds..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E3A9 {
    "If our goons didn’t bungle things\nin RUSTBORO, we wouldn’t be here!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E3ED {
    "I didn’t have ¥50, so it took a long\ntime getting by the receptionist."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E434 {
    "I want to learn about the sea and\nuse that knowledge for battling."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E477 {
    "I get all giddy and gooey when I\nsee the sea!\pFor me, CAPT. STERN is the number\none role model!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E4D7 {
    "The sea is vast without end, and\ninfinitely deep...\pThere must be many POKéMON that we\ndon’t know about."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E540 {
    "I want a sea POKéMON.\pI think it would feel cool and nice\nto hug."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E582 {
    "Aiyeeeh!\nWhat are you doing here?\pMe? I’m the TEAM {AQUA} member you\nthumped before, remember?\pHere, take this!\nYou have to forgive me!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E606 {
    "Aww, darn it!\nYou so screwed up our plans!\pI was going to rip off something\nto make up for it, but...\pJust you wait!\nYou’ll get yours one day!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E695 {
    "Awww, come on!\nYou have to take this and let me go!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E6C9 {
    "A blue fluid is spiraling inside a\nglass vessel.\p“This is an experiment to create a\nWHIRLPOOL artificially using wind.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E741 {
    "A red ball is bobbing up and down\ninside a glass vessel.\p“This is an experiment simulating a\nWATERFALL using the ball’s buoyancy.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E7C4 {
    "It’s a sample of soil from the ocean\nfloor.\p“Over many years, the remains of\nlife-forms settle at the bottom of\lthe sea making sedimentary layers.\p“By analyzing these layers, the\nancient past is revealed.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E892 {
    "It’s a sample of beach sand.\p“Stones from mountains are washed\ndown by rivers where they are\lchipped and ground down.\p“They are reduced to grains and end\nup as sand on beaches.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817E944 {
    "“OCEANIC MINI FACT 1\nWhy is seawater blue?\p“Light is composed of many colors.\p“When light passes through water,\nmost kinds of light lose color.\p“However, blue light retains its\ncolor, making the sea appear blue.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817EA19 {
    "“OCEANIC MINI FACT 2\nWhy is the sea salty?\p“Seawater contains dissolved salt in\nthe form of sodium and chlorine ions.\p“These ions leach out of rocks and are\ncarried out to sea by rain.\p“The concentration of dissolved salt\nmakes the sea salty.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817EB0D {
    "“OCEANIC MINI FACT 3\nWhich is bigger? The sea or land?\p“The sea covers about 70% of the\nplanet, and the rest is land.\p“The sea is therefore more than twice\nthe size of land.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817EBBC {
    "It’s a fossil with wavy ridges on it.\p“Soil on the ocean floor gets scoured\nby the tide.\p“The flowing seawater marks the soil\nwith small ridges and valleys.\p“If this soil becomes fossilized, it is\ncalled a ripple mark.”"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_0817EC98 {
    "A strange machine is rotating under\na glass dome.\pMaybe it’s for measuring the depth\nof something..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A927F {
    "Oh?\nDo you perhaps like POKéMON?\pI’m on assignment with the TV network.\pI’m gathering stories on POKéMON and\nTRAINERS that occurred recently.\pIf you don’t mind, could you tell me\nsomething about yourself?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A934C {
    "I’m gathering stories on POKéMON and\nTRAINERS that occurred recently.\pIf you don’t mind, could you tell me\nsomething about yourself?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A93D1 {
    "Oh, you will?\nThank you!\pThen, please, tell me anything of\ninterest that you experienced recently\linvolving POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A9446 {
    "Oh, I see...\pWell, if you do have an interesting\nstory to tell, please let me know."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A949A {
    "Oh, what an uplifting story!\pI’ll be sure to get your story told\non television.\pIt should be aired sometime, I think,\nso please look forward to it."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M06_Text_081A952E {
    "Hmmm...\nI’ve got a good story for a TV program.\pI’d better write it up in a hurry!"
}
